@startuml
title Digital Watch State Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state Idle {
    state TimeAdjustment
    state AlarmAdjustment
    state LightControl
}

Idle : entry / Display Current Time
TimeAdjustment : entry / Adjust Time Settings
TimeAdjustment : do / Increase Time Values
TimeAdjustment : exit / Save New Time
AlarmAdjustment : entry / Adjust Alarm Settings
AlarmAdjustment : do / Toggle Alarm On/Off, Set Alarm Time
AlarmAdjustment : exit / Save New Alarm Settings
LightControl : entry / Turn Light On/Off
LightControl : do / Turn Light On
LightControl : exit / Turn Light Off

TimeAdjustment --> Idle : Adjustment Completed / Display Current Time
AlarmAdjustment --> Idle : Adjustment Completed / Display Alarm Settings
LightControl --> Idle : Light Control Completed / Display Current Time
Idle --> TimeAdjustment : Time Adjustment Button Pressed
Idle --> AlarmAdjustment : Alarm Adjustment Button Pressed
Idle --> LightControl : Light Control Button Pressed
@enduml
